# Spotify Clustering & PCA

Analysis of Spotify songs from the 2010s using K-Means clustering, Hierarchical Clustering, and PCA.

## Dataset
Kaggle: Spotify Past Decades Songs (50s–10s)

## Methods 
- Data standardization
- K-Means Clustering
- Hierarchical Clustering
- Principal Component Analysis (PCA)

## Tools
Python, Pandas, Scikit-learn, Matplotlib, Google Colab

